# 白名单 .gitignore：默认拒绝一切，逐项放行。
# 目录先放行（只为能走进去），文件逐个点名。新增文件必须同步加白名单，
# 否则 check-whitelist.py 在 pre-commit 直接拦下。
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
!HANDOFF.md
!AGENTS.md
!build/Makefile
!build/main.cc
!build/NOTES.md
!build/reconf.sh
!build/reconf-batch1b.sh
!build/reconf-batch1.sh
!build/CLIBS.md
!build/GAPS.md
!build/plotbridge/*
!build/fftw_threads_stub.c
!build/second_stub.f
!build/normalize_arpack.py
!build/build_dldfcn.sh
!build/reconf-pic.sh
!build/rebuild-pic-libs.sh
!build/build_oct.sh
!bridge/octplot.html
!bridge/plotbridge.js
!vendor/MANIFEST.md
!vendor/forge/*
!vendor/extra/*
!.githooks/install.sh
!.githooks/pre-commit
!.githooks/pre-push
!.githooks/update-readme.py
!.githooks/check-whitelist.py
